Licence
=======

This repository holds the Braveheart logo artwork and the code that makes web
images from it. The two are under different terms.


The artwork: all rights reserved
--------------------------------

Every image file in this repository (each .png, .svg and .jpg: the artist's
originals in original/ and every file derived from them) is NOT open source
and is NOT covered by the MIT licence below.

- Copyright: the Braveheart logo artwork, in every version and every file
  derived from it, is copyright (c) 2026 the artist who created it. The artist
  keeps the copyright.
- Licensee: Jimmy Wallace uses the artwork under a licence from the artist
  that includes commercial use. That licence is personal to him and is not
  passed on to anyone who copies, forks or uses this repository.
- No permission granted: nothing in this repository gives you any right to
  use, copy, modify, distribute or sell the artwork, or to make derivative
  works from it. That includes forks and mirrors of this repository and of
  the Braveheart engine.

If you fork or redistribute Braveheart, leave the logo out or replace it with
your own artwork.

To ask about using the logo, open an issue on this repository.


The code: MIT
-------------

Everything that is not an image (the scripts, and the repository's
configuration and documentation) is licensed under the MIT License. Its full
text is in LICENSE-CODE.
